{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003429","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003429"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003429","label":"殷王（陳丞相世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"殷王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0045","c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0073"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0045","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","quote":"殷王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0073","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","quote":"殷王"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"殷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003429","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"殷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003429","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji056-008","person_id":"cbr-p003429","title":"殷王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","quote":"久之，項羽略地至河上，陳平往歸之，從入破秦，賜平爵卿。項羽之東王彭城也，漢王還定三秦而東，殷王反楚。項羽乃以平爲信武君，將魏王咎客在楚者以往，擊降殷王而還。項王使項悍拜平爲都尉，賜金二十溢。居無何，漢王攻下殷。項王怒，將誅定殷者將吏。陳平懼誅，乃封其金與印，使使歸項王，而平身間行杖劎亡。渡河，船人見其美丈夫獨行，疑其亡將，要中當有金玉寶器，目之，欲殺平。平恐，乃解衣躶而佐刺船。船人知其無有，乃止。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji056-008:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"殷王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0045","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"楚漢授官、爵秩、任事、左右丞相與死後用稱分存；未知端點不由首見、死亡或獨當相職推定。行事與兼職性質、古稱及來源差異仍待制度與版本覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji056-012","person_id":"cbr-p003429","surfaces":["殷王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","quote":"久之，項羽略地至河上，陳平往歸之，從入破秦，賜平爵卿。項羽之東王彭城也，漢王還定三秦而東，殷王反楚。項羽乃以平爲信武君，將魏王咎客在楚者以往，擊降殷王而還。項王使項悍拜平爲都尉，賜金二十溢。居無何，漢王攻下殷。項王怒，將誅定殷者將吏。陳平懼誅，乃封其金與印，使使歸項王，而平身間行杖劎亡。渡河，船人見其美丈夫獨行，疑其亡將，要中當有金玉寶器，目之，欲殺平。平恐，乃解衣躶而佐刺船。船人知其無有，乃止。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示名字、局部主語、授官爵與家世暫接。平城與負郭不作短名，韓王信與淮陰侯韓信、審食其與酈食其分開。上依高帝與孝文帝敘事換主語，指控與古代比擬不當已驗史實；未名者不補全名，女孫父親不由婚議推定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p005","text":"久之，項羽略地至河上，陳平往歸之，從入破秦，賜平爵卿。項羽之東王彭城也，漢王還定三秦而東，殷王反楚。項羽乃以平爲信武君，將魏王咎客在楚者以往，擊降殷王而還。項王使項悍拜平爲都尉，賜金二十溢。居無何，漢王攻下殷。項王怒，將誅定殷者將吏。陳平懼誅，乃封其金與印，使使歸項王，而平身間行杖劎亡。渡河，船人見其美丈夫獨行，疑其亡將，要中當有金玉寶器，目之，欲殺平。平恐，乃解衣躶而佐刺船。船人知其無有，乃止。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"殷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m005-00